        "original_id": "dc358137-a4a8-5843-ac33-8d2e948727bf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Donna Mills, Clint Eastwood\n- Works: Love Is a Many Splendored Thing, Play Misty for Me\n- Roles: Tobie Williams\n- Topics: acting careers, film and television\n\nFacts:\n- Donna Mills starred for three years in the soap opera Love Is a Many Splendored Thing from 1967 to 1970.\n- In 1971, Donna Mills starred as Tobie Williams, the girlfriend of Clint Eastwood's character, in the cult film Play Misty for Me.\n- Play Misty for Me is a 1971 American psychological thriller film.\n- Clint Eastwood directed and starred in Play Misty for Me in his directorial debut.",
